        "created_at": "2013-03-31T14:29:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I did a quick search, but I don't think I saw this question answered:</p><p>Do the three targets for Tempest's Chain Lightning need to be different targets?&nbsp; Can I target a Villain three times with the card, or possibly target Villain-Minion-Villain?</p><p>We played it as if the targets must be different, because it seemed a little too powerful, otherwise, but I figured I'd ask for the real ruling.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:50.921Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
