        "raw": "<p>I did a quick search, but I don&#39;t think I saw this question answered:</p><p>Do the three targets for Tempest&#39;s Chain Lightning need to be different targets?&nbsp; Can I target a Villain three times with the card, or possibly target Villain-Minion-Villain?</p><p>We played it as if the targets must be different, because it seemed a little too powerful, otherwise, but I figured I&#39;d ask for the real ruling.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
